SUMMARY:Sister Act at 6th Street Playhouse
DESCRIPTION:When disco diva Deloris Van Cartier witnesses a crime\, she’s forced into hiding—in a convent! Disguised as a nun\, she transforms the struggling choir with her powerhouse voice\, helping them find their sound while discovering her own. Nominated for five Tony Awards\, Sister Act is a joyful\, soul-stirring spectacle that proves music—and a little mischief—can work miracles! \n 
