SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Rambletone Blues Revue
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come together. \nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tasting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from across the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new sounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \nRambletone Blues Revue\nThe “Rambletone” blues revue is a hoppin’\, groovin’\, funky\, bluesy band based in the San Francisco Bay Area. The members of Rambletone are Tony Lemieux on vocals\, guitar and harmonica\, Ian Luke on drums\, Bob Fruhlinger on bass\, Stu Dahlquist on guitars\, Willy Gross on saxophone and John Snee on keyboards. \nDetails\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/saturday-live-music-at-spicy-vines-feat-rambletone-blues-revue/
LOCATION:Spicy Vines\, 441 Healdsburg Ave.\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.61341;-122.87188
