SUMMARY:Sundays in the Plaza: David Correa Trio (Latin / World Guitar)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a series of relaxing afternoons in the plaza this summer from 1:00 PM – 3:00 PM. Each week will feature a live music performance from a local band or performer. Not to be confused with Tuesdays in the Plaza\, this is a great opportunity to bring a picnic\, sit back\, relax and enjoy the melodies. \nAbout the band: Based in the San Francisco Bay Area\, David Correa is a national recording and touring artist on Baja/TSR Records. Correa and his band have been entertaining audiences since 1999 with its passionate and distinctive blend of instrumental Latin Guitar World Fusion. Blending the Spanish guitar with Afro-Cuban and Latin rhythms from Mexico & Central America and a hint of middle-eastern influenced melodies.
