SUMMARY:Sonoma Sundays on the Plaza - Alabama Mike
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Music in Place and the City of Sonoma invite you to soak up the sunshine\, sip local wine\, and dance to live music at the Sonoma Plaza Grinstead Amphitheater during Sonoma Sundays On the Plaza\, a free concert series running June 7 through October 4\, 2026. \nThis week’s lineup features Alabama Mike! Born in Talladega\, Alabama Mike’s early influences were ZZ Hill\, Johnnie ‘Soul” Taylor\, Lightning Hopkins and Junior Wells. He has won various awards and has been nominated by The Blues Foundation on several occasions. In addition\, he has played major festivals\, both domestically and internationally and is presently been referred to by some as the Future Of The Blues! \nSonoma Sundays are free and open to all\, thanks to the generous support of the Sonoma Community Center\, The Dawn Redwoods Trust\, and the McNeely Family Foundation. \nPack your picnic\, bring your dancing shoes\, and meet us on the Plaza!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sonoma-sundays-on-the-plaza-alabama-mike/
