SUMMARY:Vinyl Sunday Presents: Red\, White & Rosé
DESCRIPTION:Sixteen 600 and Vinyl Sunday Presents: Red\, White\, & Rosé – an evening of music\, food\, and celebration. The event runs from 3 – 7 PM on Sunday\, June 28 at the Sixteen 600 Tasting House. Live music by Hattie Craven Band runs from 4 – 7 PM. Food will be available for purchase from renowned North Bay chef\, Duskie Estes\, and her food truck The Black Piglet. Wine is included in all tickets\, featuring Sixteen 600’s newest releases and\, of course\, rosé. \n$42 per person\, wine included in ticket. \nPhil Sent Me members gain free entry for themselves and one guest\, as well as one meal ticket for both attendees and complimentary glasses of wine. \nMeal tickets will be available for purchase. \nSixteen is located at 589 First Street West\, Sonoma CA\, 95476. \nQuestions? Give us a call or text at (707) 721-1805.
