DESCRIPTION:Step into an immersive night of original music\, live painting\, and creative energy at The Lost Church on Sunday\, June 28th with Narayan & Janet. \nBlending soulful indie-pop\, rich harmonies\, storytelling\, and spontaneous collaboration\, Narayan & Janet will be joined by local visual artists creating live artwork throughout the performance — turning the evening into a real-time fusion of music\, color\, mood\, and community. \nExpect intimate concert vibes\, inspiring visuals\, and a room full of artists\, music lovers\, creatives\, and curious humans gathering for something a little different. \nPart concert. Part art happening. Part community experience.
